## THE COMMISSION
One small, test-only change the product owner's board already holds as a ticket and has ruled on: stop the open-site banner browser guard depending on a third-party stylesheet host, by answering that one request locally with an empty stand-in, so a slow cdnjs can no longer fail main's push Build, while the 60 measurements and every pinned count stay exactly as they are. The product owner's standing rules apply: merge-once-tested; a gate before every merge; CodeQL is organisational policy and is never bypassed or dismissed. You build and measure, a gate re-measures, Tuesday opens the PR, reads the runs and CodeQL, and lands.

